# Timer domain

Respawn window for a boss with `killed_at`, `respawn_hours` (base), `variance_hours`:

```
windowStart = killed_at + (base - variance)
windowEnd   = killed_at + (base + variance)
```

Keep calculations in `src/lib/timers.ts`. Display times in `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_TIMEZONE` (default `Europe/Moscow`).

MVP edits: `killed_at`, `alive_at` («Живой» до смены статуса), `checked_at` («нет на спавне» → проверен 20 мин), clear timer.
Catalog is seeded from CSV; no game login/password fields.

Statuses:
- alive — отмечен «Живой», держится пока не поставят таймер / проверен / сброс
- verified — «нет на спавне» в последние 20 мин
- unverified — нет таймера / отметки старше 20 мин
- waiting_far — >1ч до окна
- waiting_soon — <1ч до окна
- possible / respawned — внутри / после окна

Priority without timer: alive > verified > unverified.
Marking alive/verified/timer clears the other sighting fields.
Opening timer on possible/respawned defaults to now (new kill), not the old killed_at.

UI refreshes status every 15s while the tab is open; toast + browser Notification on possible/respawned transitions.
Realtime syncs `raid_bosses` updates across clients.
